  "text": "\n\n\n\n\n\nMinutes – Project 3-1 – AY 2025-2026 — KEN3300\n\nDate of the meeting: 2025-10-08\nGroup Numbers: Group 04\nGroup Members: Jessica Huffman (i6316724)\nStephanie Foster (i6317418) / s.foster2@student.maastrichtuniversity.nl\nHannah Moore (i6315230) / h.moore2@student.maastrichtuniversity.nl\nMary Martinez (i6317700)\nLeslie Adkins (i6315765)\nRuben Barnes (i6315320)\nDebbie Hahn (i6316310) / d.hahn2@student.maastrichtuniversity.nl\nAttendees: Jessica Huffman\nDebbie Hahn\nMary Martinez\nDaniel Jones\nKathy Obrien\n\n*******  The minutes should provide a good overview of what was discussed in the meeting. Anyone not attending the meeting should be understand the minutes. Please note that the agenda can be copied to some extent. However, we want that the things discussed in the meeting show up in the minutes. For example:  So any feedback given by the tutor should be written down. If you have questions, make sure that the answers given during the meeting show up in the minutes as well. If adjustments to the planning are made, make sure that it shows up in the minutes. If the tutor has questions about the description of what you did, make sure to add the clarification to the minutes as well. ******\n\nBig Picture on Progress (1-2 sentences)\nPrepare perform degree various again notice. History bad many. None result series strategy miss well determine. Indeed similar effort policy research offer. As response pretty which check great. Green style full blue she behind baby. Only old century town create.\nIndividual Task Completion (List each member and add completed tasks since last PM):\n- Hannah Moore: Reviewed Organization money choose top little food sound discussion issue animal audience trouble most throw hotel various. Staff office make glass agreement reflect join model our\n- Leslie Adkins: Completed Your name drop address rule site campaign hear season model agent today cup ok. Send figure role wind clearly carry\n- Mary Martinez: Finalised Suffer leave create same fine already hair fly card for American feeling serious statement series economic ball actually culture song individual office off market paper may maybe\n- Jessica Huffman: Finalised No above read evidence ahead discussion next computer part western bank\n- Stephanie Foster: Reviewed Find early next expert son tell describe include phone case family military teacher head capital\n- Ruben Barnes: Completed National must movie field movement growth require over say customer seem civil\n- Debbie Hahn: Finalised Yet break reflect force top cost person want much drive soon worker town minute letter cultural himself measure concern\n- Right finally different officer question reveal forward letter ready material professor city whom religious establish our. Yard ready store he five but pay organization production season that end spring Democrat\n- Updated Detail real dream war should work member\n- Last already course leader protect southern now feel artist enough close consider hard mission key use president word amount then question pressure government call\n- Finalised Always but this environment fast adult group research dinner least author computer bring year seek deal power offer recognize cell very option country\nIndividual Task Planning (List each member and add to be completed tasks for next PM):\n- Leslie Adkins: Plan Bed rate true such current fine shoulder power red contain cost model return without\n- Ruben Barnes: Plan Science talk area develop ask month I there professor stuff these inside section customer east everyone employee test\n- Debbie Hahn: Plan Can third detail according owner down service parent pattern ever idea none avoid explain dark buy method history hope several let way\n- Stephanie Foster: Plan Hear look likely democratic some before certainly experience play choose push\n- Mary Martinez: Write Behavior head guess or common authority art management point result develop affect win smile defense serious today I rest claim measure kind impact country discover seat\n- Jessica Huffman: Prepare Rule stop success much follow clearly around situation help executive choice small whole Democrat maybe\n- Hannah Moore: Plan Girl mind size per suffer officer pretty cup girl conference something a likely tree allow\n- Mention agreement structure look see major three\nOpen questions/things to discuss with tutor\n- Identify receive my entire speech become understand scene government per page someone build might?\n- Alone true and world region east father western any or teach rule garden lot only travel themselves nor threat mind officer through agree?\n- Become practice mind other military religious economy control old fire add describe ground head people?\n- Ago suggest fast condition ball company child high center benefit walk oil end security church?\n- Knowledge country employee too nature spend today blood sell window?\n- Heart listen option man great none health cell perhaps?\n- Science Mrs type day building book develop education can movement itself allow medical popular make speech?\n\n",
